OL,3,CSolar eclipse: Your questions answered
OL,5,FPeople in the Channel Islands will get
OL,6,Fone of the best views of the partial
OL,7,Fsolar eclipse on Wednesday 12 August.
OL,9,FWhile the islands have seen partial
OL,10,Feclipses in recent years, the sun has
OL,11,Fnot been this obscured since the
OL,12,Ffamous eclipse in 1999.
OL,14,FThe rare phenomenon is predicted to
OL,15,Fsee 94% of the sun blacked out during
OL,16,Fits peak at 7:17pm.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G1/7
