OL,3,CSolar eclipse: Your questions answered
OL,5,FThis is also expected to be followed
OL,6,Fby the Perseid meteor shower -
OL,7,Fshooting stars which appear to come
OL,8,Ffrom the constellation Perseus, last
OL,9,Fseen in the Islands in 2016.
OL,11,FHowever, islanders are reminded to be
OL,12,Fprepared to find the best places to
OL,13,Fview the eclipse and keep their eyes
OL,14,Fsafe.
OL,16,FWhat is a solar eclipse?
OL,18,FA solar eclipse occurs when the Moon
OL,19,Fpasses between the Sun and Earth,
OL,20,Fcasting a shadow on Earth.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G2/7
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
