OL,3,CSolar eclipse: Your questions answered
OL,5,FMeanwhile, a lunar eclipse occurs when
OL,6,FEarth is between the Sun and the Moon,
OL,7,Fcasting a shadow on the Moon.
OL,9,FThe momentary darkness even has an
OL,10,Feffect on nature, as birds stop
OL,11,Fchirping, and some types of flowers
OL,12,Fwill close their leaves.
OL,14,FWhen will the partial eclipse be
OL,15,Fvisible from the Channel Islands?
OL,17,FIt is due to take place on Wednesday
OL,18,F12 August, starting at 6:20pm and
OL,19,Ffinishing at 8:10pm.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G3/7
