OL,3,CSolar eclipse: Your questions answered
OL,5,FThe sun will be most obscured at
OL,6,F7:17pm.
OL,8,FWhat measures should you take to watch
OL,9,Fthe eclipse safely?
OL,11,FYou should never look at an eclipse or
OL,12,Fa partial eclipse directly, as it can
OL,13,Fpermanently damage your eyes and even
OL,14,Fcause blindness.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G4/7
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
