OL,3,CSolar eclipse: Your questions answered
OL,5,FAlternatively, experts say you can use
OL,6,Fa mirror if you follow these steps:
OL,7,Fcover a small flat mirror with paper
OL,8,Fthat has a small hole cut in it. The
OL,9,Fhole does not have to be circular but
OL,10,Fshould be no wider than 5mm. Prop up
OL,11,For clamp the mirror so that it
OL,12,Freflects the sunlight onto a pale
OL,13,Fscreen or wall, ideally through a
OL,14,Fwindow.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G6/7
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
